{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFishing Worldwide Desktop\u300b is a desktop game that accompanies you during work and study. You can fish in various locations around the world, collect different species, and learn about their appearances while enjoying some leisure time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/065f2ca802ac693d1bdc2652a94cacb4.avif?t=1755687497\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue to explore this game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/ef5f9088655c496f7a2c86474d728788.avif?t=1755687497\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It accompanies your study, work, and leisure time with just occasional mouse clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also adjust the time for fish to bite; if you think it\u2019s too frequent, or if you want to catch more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/68de3bc57bfeb4a68509e6b6aacd7b8a.poster.avif?t=1755687497\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/68de3bc57bfeb4a68509e6b6aacd7b8a.webm?t=1755687497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/68de3bc57bfeb4a68509e6b6aacd7b8a.mp4?t=1755687497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, the star of the fishing show: the Scottish Fold big ginger cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/d3f19dcba8eec0afb571ebdd2f59f12e.avif?t=1755687497\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to fish in Hawaii, Tokyo, the Maldives, or even the Arctic Ocean? There are over 20 famous locations waiting for you to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/07a17c9263c5c781f78eb1ea7d5d8f87.avif?t=1755687497\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel fish are waiting for you to collect, with different fish swimming at varying frequencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/83a0e2b0c2803d20d42a4758b622d8e3.avif?t=1755687497\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can place this game anywhere on your screen while studying or working, and it won't disrupt what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/extras/8d2b149b156ec955811ac556a71ba9de.avif?t=1755687497\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904080?t=1755687497","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/4f63a2e5edd2f947a9d314762b7671be9e3d8cc1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755687497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904080/f9ff8878198b5d3d3374ab59b91cdd481a7c96a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755687497","capsule_imagev5":